+- **Partners** (see strategy doc): Model labs, ComfyUI-MCP, lore tools, infra (GitHub/Supabase), MCP ecosystem.
+
+This engine turns imagination into owned, evolving reality at any scale — responsibly, swarm-powered, sovereign.
+
+*Execute via skills, swarms, and persistent artifacts.*
